# Planted bugs for the transactional design. Each one must make its property fail.
run fv-tlc IdempotentReceiver.tla OneTransaction.cfg WitnessAckAfterCrash.cfg
properties AtMostOnce AckedImpliesApplied EventuallyAcked
file IdempotentReceiver.tla

mutation the transaction commits the effect without the dedup record
detects AtMostOnce
-     /\ effects' = effects + 1 /\ seen' = TRUE /\ pc' = "ack"
+     /\ effects' = effects + 1 /\ seen' = seen /\ pc' = "ack"

mutation the transaction commits the dedup record without the effect
detects AckedImpliesApplied
-     /\ effects' = effects + 1 /\ seen' = TRUE /\ pc' = "ack"
+     /\ effects' = effects /\ seen' = TRUE /\ pc' = "ack"

mutation a redelivered message is never acked
detects EventuallyAcked
-     /\ pc' = IF seen THEN "ack" ELSE "first"
+     /\ pc' = IF seen THEN "idle" ELSE "first"

harmless a comment on the crash action
- \* Fault: the consumer crashes and restarts.
+ \* Fault: the consumer crashes and restarts with its durable state.
